  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women Advocate for Peace</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme aims to contribute to a lasting peace process with gender justice in Colombia, in which women and girls have equal rights and opportunities. This will be done through the creation of enabling condition to strengthen participation, influence and leadership of women and their organisations in peace-building at different levels. The programme is built on three interlinked thematic pillars: peace process, accompaniment &amp; protection and women&#x2019;s empowerment.</narrative>
  </description>
